OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday will be grey and murky
OL,6,Fwith spells of rain and drizzle which
OL,7,Fmay be heavier at times, particularly
OL,8,Ffor the hills. Breezy, with strong
OL,9,Fwinds in the north later. Feeling very
OL,10,Fmild and rather muggy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA clear and dry respite this
OL,13,Fevening, but drizzly interludes will
OL,14,Freturn followed by heavy rain in the
OL,15,Fnorth later. Breezy, and strong winds
OL,16,Ffor exposed areas. A mild night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
