OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA wet and windy start as
OL,6,Fheavy rain sweeps eastwards. Despite
OL,7,Fthe sunny spells, the afternoon will
OL,8,Ffeel cooler than on Monday with a
OL,9,Ffresh, blustery breeze following the
OL,10,Frain.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FOn
OL,13,FWednesday, bright spells but
OL,14,Fincreasingly strong winds with coastal
OL,15,Fgales. Winds easing through Thursday,
OL,16,Fbut a band of heavy rain passes. A
OL,17,Fsunnier, more settled Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
